    "custom_liquid_YXWHeB": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "t:names.custom_liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<!--\n  Everstory PDP — PRODUCT-SPECIFIC intro (EN). product info 블록 *안* metafield 값.\n  SKU 마다 아래 해당 블록을 통째로 그 상품의 metafield 에 붙여넣는다.\n\n  CSS 없음 — 같은 페이지의 공용 블록(everstory_pdp_general_en.html)이 깐\n  .es-pdp <style> 를 재사용. 이 fragment 에 <style> 절대 금지(SKU 수만큼 중복됨).\n  운영 규칙: 이 블록을 쓰는 상품 페이지엔 공용 블록도 반드시 같이 둔다.\n\n  Voice (docs/design/voice.md):\n  - eyebrow 는 SKU 라벨. 원본 \"Made to keep\" 은 태그라인 단일절 → Product 페이지\n    금지(voice.md 태그라인 규칙)라 의도적으로 교체함. 되돌리지 말 것.\n  - 명사·동사 중심, 형용사 최소, 자가 라벨링/과장/귀여움 금지.\n  - subject-neutral (brand.md: 피사체 카테고리 아닌 분위기 일치).\n\n  사진: image-placeholder = 슬롯 설명. 실제로는 상품 미디어/metafield 이미지로 교체.\n  Content SOT: everstory_product_detail_pdp_block.html (KO 원본). KO/EN 카피만 차이.\n  구조 변경 시 KO 분리본 + full_template 3-way 동기화 필요(후속).\n-->\n\n<!-- ============================================================\n     SKU: FACE STICKER\n     ============================================================ -->\n<div class=\"es-pdp\" lang=\"en\">\n  <div class=\"es-page\">\n    <section class=\"es-section\" aria-label=\"Product introduction\">\n      <div class=\"es-section-shell\">\n        <div class=\"heading-block\">\n          <span class=\"es-eyebrow\">Face sticker</span>\n          <h2>Their face, kept.</h2>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"photo-pair\">\n          <div class=\"photo-frame\">\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0833/4760/3712/files/phone_sample.heic?v=1779210270\" alt=\"Face sticker on a phone case\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"photo-frame\">\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0833/4760/3712/files/laptop_sample.heic?v=1779210253\" alt=\"Face sticker on a laptop\">\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"copy\">\n          Your photo, traced and cut by hand into a die-cut sticker of the face and shoulders.\n          A white edge sits clean on a planner, a phone case, a laptop.\n          Choose your size; we pack each sheet by hand.\n        </p>\n\n        <div class=\"single-photo\" style=\"margin-top: 56px;\">\n          <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0833/4760/3712/files/a5_sheet_real.jpg?v=1779213575\" alt=\"Printed A5 sticker sheet\">\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- ============================================================\n     SKU: FULL BODY STICKER\n     ============================================================ -->\n<div class=\"es-pdp\" lang=\"en\">\n  <div class=\"es-page\">\n    <section class=\"es-section\" aria-label=\"Product introduction\">\n      <div class=\"es-section-shell\">\n        <div class=\"heading-block\">\n          <span class=\"es-eyebrow\">Full body sticker</span>\n          <h2>The whole subject, kept.</h2>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"photo-pair\">\n          <div class=\"photo-frame\">\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0833/4760/3712/files/temp_1.png\" alt=\"Face sticker on a phone case\">\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"photo-frame\">\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0833/4760/3712/files/temp_2.png\" alt=\"Face sticker on a planner · laptop\">\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"copy\">\n          Your photo, traced and cut by hand into a die-cut sticker of the full subject — pose and all.\n          It reads best at 1.25&Prime; and up.\n          Choose your size; we pack each sheet by hand.\n        </p>\n\n        <div class=\"single-photo\" style=\"margin-top: 56px;\">\n          <div class=\"image-placeholder\">Packaging<br>Hand-packed by the order</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- ============================================================\n     SKU: CIRCLE STICKER\n     ============================================================ -->\n<div class=\"es-pdp\" lang=\"en\">\n  <div class=\"es-page\">\n    <section class=\"es-section\" aria-label=\"Product introduction\">\n      <div class=\"es-section-shell\">\n        <div class=\"heading-block\">\n          <span class=\"es-eyebrow\">Circle sticker</span>\n          <h2>Cropped to a circle.</h2>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"photo-pair\">\n          <div class=\"photo-frame\">\n            <div class=\"image-placeholder\">In use 1<br>Circle sticker on a tumbler</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"photo-frame\">\n            <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0833/4760/3712/files/laptop_sample.heic?v=1779210253\"\n              alt=\"Circle sticker on a laptop\">\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"copy\">\n          Your photo, cropped to a clean circle and cut by hand.\n          The round edge sits evenly on a laptop, a tumbler, a phone case.\n          Choose your size; we pack each sheet by hand.\n        </p>\n\n        <div class=\"single-photo\" style=\"margin-top: 56px;\">\n          <div class=\"image-placeholder\">Packaging<br>Hand-packed by the order</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- ============================================================\n     SKU: PACKAGE MINI  (curated · 4 selected · 2 A5 sheets · size 선택 없음)\n     ============================================================ -->\n<div class=\"es-pdp\" lang=\"en\">\n  <div class=\"es-page\">\n    <section class=\"es-section\" aria-label=\"Product introduction\">\n      <div class=\"es-section-shell\">\n        <div class=\"heading-block\">\n          <span class=\"es-eyebrow\">Package mini</span>\n          <h2>A small set, curated.</h2>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"copy\">\n          Upload a few photos for each print size.\n          We choose the strongest set, lay them out, and cut them by hand.\n          The selection is ours; the photos are yours.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- ============================================================\n     SKU: PACKAGE FULL  (curated · 8 selected · 3 A5 sheets · size 선택 없음)\n     ============================================================ -->\n<div class=\"es-pdp\" lang=\"en\">\n  <div class=\"es-page\">\n    <section class=\"es-section\" aria-label=\"Product introduction\">\n      <div class=\"es-section-shell\">\n        <div class=\"heading-block\">\n          <span class=\"es-eyebrow\">Package full</span>\n          <h2>A full set, curated.</h2>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"copy\">\n          Upload a few photos for each print size.\n          We choose the strongest set, lay them out, and cut them by hand.\n          The selection is ours; the photos are yours.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n</div>",
